=T("23"),05/05/1994," PET Technologies, Inc."," PET"," Polyethylene terephthalate (PET)"," Physical"," Non-food contact layer in PET articles for holding aqueous, acidic, and low-alcoholic foods under Condition of Use C (Hot filled or pasteurized above 150 °F) and below, providing recycled PET is separated from food by a layer of virgin, food grade PET &ge;1 mil thick, and the food-contact article is used for storage periods not to exceed one year."
